  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 24/07/2025, the proposal as shown on the drawing 'Location plan (unnumbered, 1:1250), 22 001, cover letter' submitted on 24/07/2025 was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 because:\r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Article 3, Schedule 2, Part 1, Class E of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the outbuilding, by virtue of its size cannot be considered to be incidental to the main house and, furthermore, no justification as to why an outbuilding of this scale is 'reasonably required' for purposes incidental to the occupation of the dwellinghouse has been provided\r\n"
